<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-FRENCH LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FRENCH LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of French first division</p>
<p>matches on Saturday:</p>
<p>Monaco 3 (Legwinski 5, Henry 44, 65) Bordeaux 1 (Ba 71).</p>
<p>Halftime 2-0. Attendance 5,000</p>
<p>Le Havre 0 Auxerre 2 (Goma 23, Saib 82). 0-1. 17,000.</p>
<p>Nantes 3 (Gourvennec 6 pen, Ndoram 33, Ferri 52) Strasbourg 0.</p>
