<p>Guingamp 0 Metz 1 (Adam 88). 0-0. 9.000.</p>
<p>Cannes 0 Lille 1 (Boutoilles 34). 0-1. 3,500.</p>
<p>Montpellier 2 (Bakayoko 10, 46) Marseille 0. 1-0. 11,000.</p>
<p>Nancy 1 (Sechet 79) Caen 2 (Fernandez 70, Bancarel 82). 0-0.</p>
